IELTS.lesson({"test": 4, "part": 2, "title": "Test 4, Part 2 — the long turn", "candidate": "rawan", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes.", "ar": "الآن، سأعطيكِ موضوعاً وأريدكِ أن تتحدّثي عنه مدة دقيقة إلى دقيقتين.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93e218b519712f7a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Before you talk you'll have one minute to think about what you're going to say. You can make some notes if you wish. Do you understand?", "ar": "قبل أن تتحدّثي سيكون لديكِ دقيقة واحدة للتفكير في ما ستقولينه. ويمكنكِ تدوين بعض الملاحظات إن أردتِ. هل هذا واضح؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5a7c17f0603cb77a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, I understand.", "ar": "نعم، واضح.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/6e8d454b0d7fda7b.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Here is some paper and a pencil for making notes, and here is your topic.", "ar": "هذه ورقة وقلم لتدوين الملاحظات، وهذا موضوعكِ.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dcc80d495df59156.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "I'd like you to describe an app or a website you use a lot.", "ar": "أودّ منكِ أن تصفي تطبيقاً أو موقعاً تستخدمينه كثيراً.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a38400e69b646687.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "You have one minute. I'll tell you when the minute is up.", "ar": "لديكِ دقيقة واحدة. سأخبركِ عندما تنتهي الدقيقة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b1e1b3092896694.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "All right? Remember you have one to two minutes for this. Don't worry if I stop you. I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now, please?", "ar": "حسناً؟ تذكّري أن لديكِ دقيقة إلى دقيقتين. لا تقلقي إن أوقفتكِ. سأخبركِ عندما ينتهي الوقت. هل يمكنكِ أن تبدئي الحديث الآن من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/12de1969ab105c17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'm going to pick a boring one, because the honest answer isn't the design software. It's a currency app. Just an exchange rate app, nothing clever.", "ar": "سأختار تطبيقاً مملّاً، لأنّ الجواب الصادق ليس برنامج التصميم. إنّه تطبيق عملات. مجرّد تطبيق لسعر الصرف، لا شيء ذكيّ فيه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/f46c70f9f56bbc15.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I started using it about two years ago, after a client abroad paid me in dollars and the money reached Damascus in lira, and I couldn't work out whether the payment was short or whether the rate had moved.", "ar": "بدأت باستخدامه قبل سنتين تقريباً، بعد أن دفع لي زبون في الخارج بالدولار ووصل المبلغ إلى دمشق بالليرة، ولم أستطع أن أعرف إن كانت الدفعة ناقصة أم أنّ السعر تحرّك.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/53cbc9d85c70bf98.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "And that's a bad position to be in, right? Because you either say nothing and feel cheated, or you accuse somebody of something and you're wrong. I just didn't have the information.", "ar": "وهذا موقف سيّئ، أليس كذلك؟ لأنّكِ إمّا أن تسكتي وتشعري أنّكِ غُبنتِ، أو تتّهمي أحدهم بشيء وتكوني مخطئة. لم تكن لديّ المعلومة ببساطة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/875611d9a830f24e.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Now I check it before I quote, when I invoice, and when the money lands. Three times per job, every job.", "ar": "الآن أتفقّده قبل أن أعطي عرض السعر، وحين أصدر الفاتورة، وحين يصل المبلغ. ثلاث مرّات في كلّ عمل، في كلّ عمل.", "shot": "two", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/143355456f31c138.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "And I also check it at eleven at night for no reason at all, which isn't healthy.", "ar": "وأتفقّده أيضاً في الحادية عشرة ليلاً بلا سبب إطلاقاً، وهذا ليس صحّياً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/02d4f59b82c7e930.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "The reason it's actually useful, though, isn't the money. It's that it lets me have the conversation.", "ar": "لكنّ سبب فائدته الحقيقيّة ليس المال. بل أنّه يتيح لي أن أجري الحوار.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/c772ddd3c8ea3f44.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "If a payment comes in short I can say, on this date the rate was this, so I think something's gone wrong.", "ar": "إذا وصلت دفعة ناقصة أستطيع أن أقول: في هذا التاريخ كان السعر كذا، لذلك أظنّ أنّ خطأً ما قد حصل.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/18aa360aff327e74.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "That's a completely different conversation from saying I think you've paid me less.", "ar": "وهذا حوار مختلف تماماً عن أن أقول أظنّ أنّك دفعت لي أقلّ.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/19286a4057feffb5.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "One of them is a fact and one of them is an accusation, and when the client is four thousand kilometres away and you've never met them, the difference between those two is your whole career.", "ar": "أحدهما واقعة والآخر اتّهام، وحين يكون الزبون على بعد أربعة آلاف كيلومتر ولم تلتقيه قطّ، فإنّ الفرق بين الاثنين هو مهنتكِ كلّها.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/bf664ca087607dbe.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "So, an exchange rate app. It's the least interesting thing on my phone and it's the one I'd replace first.", "ar": "إذاً، تطبيق سعر صرف. هو أقلّ شيء إثارةً على هاتفي وهو الذي سأستبدله أوّلاً لو اضطررت.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/ee226ba566177cdf.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe an app or a website you use a lot.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it is</li><li>how you started using it</li><li>what you use it for</li><li>and explain why it is useful to you</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. Do you recommend it to other people?", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. هل تنصحين الآخرين به؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/9bbe2d1a3b0a9dfa.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "To other freelancers, constantly. Everybody I know who works like this has had the same bad week, they just had it on their own.", "ar": "أنصح به العاملين لحسابهم باستمرار. كلّ من أعرفه يعمل بهذه الطريقة مرّ بالأسبوع السيّئ نفسه، لكنّه مرّ به وحده.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120", "clip": "../clips/29c0f568f264baa1.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part Two.", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. بهذا ينتهي القسم الثاني.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/264fec5248fac38c.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Describe an app or a website you use a lot.", "bullets": ["what it is", "how you started using it", "what you use it for", "and explain why it is useful to you"], "long": true, "model": "I'm going to pick a boring one, because the honest answer isn't the design software. It's a currency app. Just an exchange rate app, nothing clever. I started using it about two years ago, after a client abroad paid me in dollars and the money reached Damascus in lira, and I couldn't work out whether the payment was short or whether the rate had moved. And that's a bad position to be in, right? Because you either say nothing and feel cheated, or you accuse somebody of something and you're wrong. I just didn't have the information. Now I check it before I quote, when I invoice, and when the money lands. Three times per job, every job. And I also check it at eleven at night for no reason at all, which isn't healthy. The reason it's actually useful, though, isn't the money. It's that it lets me have the conversation. If a payment comes in short I can say, on this date the rate was this, so I think something's gone wrong. That's a completely different conversation from saying I think you've paid me less. One of them is a fact and one of them is an accusation, and when the client is four thousand kilometres away and you've never met them, the difference between those two is your whole career. So, an exchange rate app. It's the least interesting thing on my phone and it's the one I'd replace first.", "modelBand": 7.5, "why": "not design sw — the currency one 2 yrs ago, client paid wrong every invoice, every day it's not about money, it's about ARGUING"}, {"q": "Do you recommend it to other people?", "model": "To other freelancers, constantly. Everybody I know who works like this has had the same bad week, they just had it on their own.", "modelBand": 7.5, "why": ""}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-hfc_female-medium-s120"}});
